* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-svcb-ech (+0/-2/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  2 pull requests merged:
  - Mention situations that result in mixed ECH/non-ECH
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-svcb-ech/pull/22=20
  - Add a reference for traffic analysis
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-svcb-ech/pull/23=20

* tlswg/sslkeylogfile (+1/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  1 pull requests submitted:
  - Fix typo for EARLY_EXPORTER_SECRET label (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/sslkeylogfile/pull/22=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+2/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC1)
  2 pull requests submitted:
  - Remove normative references to paywalled crypto (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1370=20
  - Editorial updates to references (by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1369=20

  1 pull requests received 1 new comments:
  - #1369 Editorial updates to references (1 by emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1369=20


